  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You wrap foes up and knock them out.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Pinning Knockout<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you deal nonlethal damage to a pinned target, you deal triple damage instead of double damage. In addition, if your target has damage reduction that applies specifically to nonlethal damage, such as an invulnerable rager barbarian, or temporary immunity to nonlethal damage due to a spell, item, or similar effect, you can expend one use of your mythic power as a free action to ignore that damage reduction for 1 minute. This does not apply to creatures that are naturally immune to nonlethal damage, such as constructs and undead.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc26\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
